cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalog or these scripts, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Myoepithelial carcinoma: a reference to the published research"
abstract: >-
  A catalog of the published research on myoepithelial carcinoma, a rare
  cancer, compiled from open sources by a patient: bibliographic records for
  10,435 works, 527 registered trials, a registry of 479
  published single-patient reports, and tables of treatments, stains and
  look-alike tumors extracted from the literature, with the scripts that
  gather the records and build the reference site. Abstracts and full text
  are not included.
authors:
  - family-names: Saddington
    given-names: Peter
url: "https://staas.fund/myoepithelial-carcinoma/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/agilepeter/myoepithelial-carcinoma"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
version: "2026-11-12"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
keywords:
  - myoepithelial carcinoma
  - malignant myoepithelioma
  - rare cancer
  - bibliography
  - case registry
  - open data
